      "returnType": "FRenderBounds",
      "docs": "Get the primitive-relative bounds for the instance. These are the local bounds transformed into Primitive relative space using InstanceToPrimitiveRelative transform.\nNote that this may contain instance rotation which may possibly lead to expansion of the bounds that is less tight than a transformed sphere bounds.\nClamps the index to the InstanceLocalBounds size (it is always 1:1 with the instance count or exactly 1)."
